(7711671, 1267303, 36808, '<td valign="top">I got this tiny vase at a thrift store years ago.  

<br/>It fits in the palm of my hand so I set it on a chopstick stand for the shoot.

<br/>Just recently, it fell hard and part of the rim broke.  I decided to try to fix it, kintsugi-style.

<br/>Im so happy with the results!

<br/>Thank you for the votes and comments.

<br/></td>', 'I got this tiny vase at a thrift store years ago.  

It fits in the palm of my hand so I set it on a chopstick stand for the shoot.

Just recently, it fell hard and part of the rim broke.  I decided to try to fix it, kintsugi-style.

Im so happy with the results!

Thank you for the votes and comments.

', '2022-01-14 00:54:15.000000', NULL, 0),
